{"product_id":"the-littles-go-exploring","title":"The Littles Go Exploring","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe tenth book from this classic series is ready to grab the attention of a new generation! Fresh cover art brings an updated look to this timeless favorite.  Years ago, Grandpa Little set off to explore and was never seen again and the mystery of his disappearance was never solved. But now, Lucy and Tom have stumbled across a secret room where Grandpa kept many papers and maps. And they think they can figure out the path he took into the wilderness the last time he set out on an expedition! The family packs up and heads upstream. Surprises await them around every bend -- huge turtles, river rapids, and a new family of tiny people! But when their odyssey is over, will the Littles know any more about what happened to Grandpa Little?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 183\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: John Peterson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780590465960\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 94\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400858265,"sku":"17RE-2-9780590465960","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/5d_u1263407_0_JohnPeterson_TheLittlesGoExploringLittles.webp?v=1763203798","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-littles-go-exploring","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}